{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Upgrade your Cult. Watch your horde grow and the love flow as you draw new recruits to the eyeball. Guide the rituals and offerings to the attention God within a beautiful model diorama world full of chaos and blood sacrifice.  Turn attention into power in this dark and comedic satire as you:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit &amp; Rise:</strong> Draw new followers and keep them chanting as your horde grows.<br><strong>Upgrade the Faith:</strong> Unlock wild perks\u2014from influencer apostles to deranged ad campaigns.<br><strong>Worship &amp; Offerings:</strong> Convert attention into devotion through ever-bolder sacrifices.<br><strong>Diorama Delight:</strong> A beautiful, toy-like world where cute meets catastrophic.<br><strong>The Eye Sees All:</strong> Whether you triumph or perish gloriously, the Eyeball God approves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011600/extras/b68069445abfbda1a912e3caf9cdcd0b.poster.avif?t=1764754732\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011600/extras/b68069445abfbda1a912e3caf9cdcd0b.webm?t=1764754732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011600/extras/b68069445abfbda1a912e3caf9cdcd0b.mp4?t=1764754732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011600/extras/67da91a4b3e8c514f7ac116ddc5e8248.poster.avif?t=1764754732\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011600/extras/67da91a4b3e8c514f7ac116ddc5e8248.webm?t=1764754732\" type=\"video/webm; code